d": "1759901891583835", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_1759901894917168_1755884751114998428_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HeQQvOUwdKIQ7kNvwEVLXlv&_nc_oc=AdmwzBoXqyZeQDQD8W-CllZTO9S8td0N3Aj2palcEpvuTZU0BGinfv_JYeccGEhhSqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftH8LcnSteNMcpx-eI37ppkflx0apOEZx5iWSCqtsYZlA&oe=699C5785"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "691900473696934", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499326349_691900477030267_8034961341760562964_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qQ2dh0OHOsQ7kNvwEiOUEI&_nc_oc=AdkyE8aVraQykDYtVZzPtAbWbu8ClRkej-lTLW3Q_hIvGgU7tcfn9dhX4sqDC2h0ReU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afty5_VVTuGhZCC0Kk745EXk0zdbZ4RBJ0AEHRgVPHYoCw&oe=699C635D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "701610639047065", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311591_701610642380398_6712854599056515091_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tlfYJDMLJC4Q7kNvwFvobFc&_nc_oc=AdkqC3q51qTE-oIP9xn_SNvfp-TK021Zt-e4CMtg2zFo6WuxT_GPCRmdPbrw5XA3JpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftNY1PdHMkrLyV12lENoDm1_19VDnPwxHCo_osbT96-sQ&oe=699C3D52"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1448057773232210", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318571_1448057776565543_7678358617141313131_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eC3LYvcCAbIQ7kNvwG9ZFnV&_nc_oc=AdmyZDqAWkhrs1nGd_6s4bX66fRJuJ9LkyXy_4bSk2T_Q-8ZKdEvgJ26GbY5Y2heCS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuDhsY1Co5ySR3_wlU7jlYhxx1OiHr3Q5hNireoL2qSvw&oe=699C515C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DF_MA_META_HEADER_COVERLAND_TRAILERCOVER.png", "id": "1646731639656721", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831792_1646731642990054_4019563495684792553_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MPChs_Z1n98Q7kNvwGqcbx8&_nc_oc=Adk0QMvowmcsKiHRbkWnzai7pz_5L042eUsUN_ruCplkg4-vqoWOnj4rzW0KYJ0DMos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft23fRjs5CTe-NhrTVrZdML661B3XXPZO0tzZMvAGodNw&oe=699C37D7"}, "display_name": "Dragon Fist: VR Kung Fu", "keywords": ["fighting", "kungfu", "physics", "boxing", "simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n{1194756028402406}\n# **The Legend Begins...**\nA ruthless master rises. Vengeful emperors scheme. Peasants sharpen their blades. They all have something to prove\u2014and only one path forward: **Kung Fu.**\n\n{1903052986827168}\n# **Step Into Your Own Kung Fu Movie**\nYou\u2019re not watching a Kung Fu movie\u2014you\u2019re in it. Dragon Fist delivers fast-paced melee combat powered by physics and real martial arts.\n\n{808577998151364}\n# **Hone in Your Skills**\nPractice strikes, blocks, dodges, and combos. There is an endless amount of combat to explore.\n\n{354077967776881}\n# **Play Your Way**\n- Campaign\n- Multiplayer (up to 8)\n- Co-op Campaign\n- Training\n- and More...\n\n=========================\n\n# New DLC: Midnight Alley\n\nTake the fight to the streets! Midnight Alley contains a new environment for single and multiplayer modes, and 3 new characters.\n\n- **New Environment - The Alley:** A narrow streetside area lit by lanterns, windows and the moon. Features breakable doors that allow you to enter side buildings.\n- **3 New Characters:** Play as The Landlady, The Centipede, and White Eagle, each with their own perks, weaknesses, and special moves.", "short_description": "Step into your own Kung Fu Movie! This first-person Kung Fu fighter with stylized graphics, physics-based combat, and multiplayer pays homage to the golden era of martial arts films. Play with up to 8 friends in multiplayer modes like Co-Op, PvP, Challenges, or take on an expansive singleplayer campaign.